/-! # Normalized word-image tensors of the identification Eighth[18]- <-> Root8[2]+ (record
r8f:R82+, e = 1)

The net field values of the packed tensors `wR8fR82pTHX` and `wR8fR82pTGX` (divided by `2 ^ 12`
and `2 ^ 29`), stored as compact literals and certified by one cross-sum check per column; the
parts evaluate no word image. -/

